{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">北大嶼山公路有貨車起火司機逃去，往機場方向近東涌東交匯處一度全線封閉。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"Picture_J.CARFIRE-0600.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026jzN5V7mEnZ1786747787.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.CARFIRE-0600.jpg\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">網上有片段顯示，涉事貨車意外後火光熊熊，冒出大量濃煙。車頭嚴重焚毀。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"Picture_J.CARFIRE-0600_001.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026DkGD8kuiZ51786747795.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.CARFIRE-0600_001.jpg\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">事發在凌晨三時許，一架載有電子產品的貨車沿北大嶼山公路往機場方向行駛。駛至東涌東交匯處，懷疑失控撞向鐵欄，車身之後起火，一度傳出爆炸聲。消防到場後出動一條喉及一隊煙帽隊將火撲熄。司機在意外後離開現場，警方正追查他的下落。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">北大嶼山公路往機場方向早上近八時全線解封。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-15T01:18:35.462027+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":203,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}